{"abstract":"Notice is hereby given that on March 25, 2022, the presiding administrative law judge has issued an Initial Determination on Section 337 Violation and a Recommended Determination on Remedy and Bonding in the above-captioned investigation. The Commission is soliciting comments on public interest issues raised by the recommended relief should the Commission find a violation. This notice is soliciting public interest comments from the public only.","action":"Notice.","agencies":[{"id":262,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/262","name":"International Trade Commission","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"INTERNATIONAL TRADE COMMISSION","slug":"international-trade-commission","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/international-trade-commission"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06855.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"87 FR 19122","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":null,"disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Investigation No. 337-TA-1244"],"dockets":[],"document_number":"2022-06855","effective_on":null,"end_page":19123,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2022/04/01/2022-06855.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2022/04/01/2022-06855/certain-batteries-and-products-containing-same-notice-of-request-for-statements-on-the-public","images":{},"images_metadata":{},"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents/2022-06855?publication_date=2022-04-01","mods_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/metadata/granule/FR-2022-04-01/2022-06855/mods.xml","not_received_for_publication":null,"page_length":2,"page_views":{"count":92,"last_updated":"2026-10-23 08:15:04 -0400"},"pdf_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2022-04-01/pdf/2022-06855.pdf","presidential_document_number":null,"proclamation_numbe